Package: tind-desktop
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: tind-branding, gnome-core, gnome-shell-extension-dashtodock, gnome-software, gnome-software-plugin-flatpak, flatpak, cups, system-config-printer, bluez, ufw, unattended-upgrades, network-manager, systemd-resolved
Recommends: firmware-linux, firmware-misc-nonfree, firmware-realtek, firmware-atheros, firmware-iwlwifi, mesa-vulkan-drivers, vulkan-tools, btrfs-progs, snapper, grub-btrfs, fonts-noto, fonts-noto-color-emoji, xdg-desktop-portal-gnome, gnome-tweaks, apt-listchanges
Installed-Size: 4
Description: Tind desktop: GNOME core, Flatpak, printing, firewall, safe updates
 Metapackage that pulls in everything the Tind base desktop needs: GNOME with
 the persistent dock, GNOME Software with Flatpak, printing, Bluetooth, a
 default-deny firewall, unattended security updates, non-free firmware and
 the Mesa Vulkan stack. Packages in Recommends are installed by default but
 will not break the build if one is renamed in Debian.
